# Schedule date picker

Pick project start/end dates on the shared calendar modal (booked jobs, visits, personal events). Do not copy the FullCalendar modal from the project show page.

```blade
@include('admin.partials.schedule_date_picker', [
    'startDateId' => 'cp-start-date',
    'endDateId' => 'cp-end-date',
    'scheduleToggleId' => 'cp-create-schedule-enabled', // optional
    'excludeProjectId' => $project->id ?? null,         // omit current job
    // Optional. On an existing project, Use these dates saves immediately.
    'saveUrl' => isset($project) ? route('admin.client-projects.schedule-dates.update', $project) : null,
])
```

JS: `AdminScheduleDatePicker` (`public/js/admin-schedule-date-picker.js`). Button: `admin-btn admin-btn--outline`.
